Alembic migrations for AgentForge.

Setup:
    pip install alembic
    alembic init ui/backend/db/migrations

    # Edit alembic.ini: set sqlalchemy.url = ${DATABASE_URL}
    # Edit env.py: import Base from ui.backend.db.models

Generate a migration:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add users table"

Apply migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

Rollback:
    alembic downgrade -1

Production deploy:
    alembic upgrade head   # run before starting the app server

Self-hosted note:
    Migrations run automatically on first start in development.
    In production, always run 'alembic upgrade head' as a pre-deploy step
    or in an init container before the API pod starts.
